# Core hours

Core hours are from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026. Where the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies.[[cite:obs-8ef10c22fec9d771aa19a25b9d32c7b81cb314e4 "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]]
